## .NET Backend .gitignore
## Based on: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore

# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Publish output
[Pp]ublish/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# .NET User Secrets (local dev credentials — NEVER commit)
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.*.json
# Un-ignore the committed settings files:
!**/appsettings.json
!**/appsettings.Development.json

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
project.lock.json
packages/

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage

# Misc
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
